\"]}]]}]\n9a:[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"dg-schedRow\",\"data-stage\":\"window\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedHead\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"u-mono dg-schedNum\",\"children\":\"04\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedName\",\"children\":\"Reporting\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedWhen u-mono\",\"children\":\"Days 9–11\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedStage\",\"children\":\"Inside the engagement window\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedArt\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedArtKey\",\"children\":\"Drops out\"}],\"Technical report\"]}]]}]\n9b:[\"$\",\"li\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"dg-schedRow\",\"data-stage\":\"after\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedHead\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"u-mono dg-schedNum\",\"children\":\"05\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedName\",\"children\":\"Debrief\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedWhen u-mono\",\"children\":\"Within 5 days of the report\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedStage\",\"children\":\"After the report\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedArt\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedArtKey\",\"children\":\"Drops out\"}],\"90-minute debrief with the testers\"]}]]}]\n9c:[\"$\",\"li\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"dg-schedRow\",\"data-stage\":\"after\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedHead\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"u-mono dg-schedNum\",\"children\":\"06\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedName\",\"children\":\"Retest\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedWhen u-mono\",\"children\":\"Within 30 days\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedStage\",\"children\":\"After the report\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedArt\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedArtKey\",\"children\":\"Drops out\"}],\"Retest report within 30 days with a per-finding verified status\"]}]]}]\n9d:[\"$\",\"figcaption\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-cap\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-legend\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-legendItem\",\"data-stage\":\"before\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-legendMark\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],\"Before the window opens\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-legendItem\",\"data-stage\":\"window\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-legendMark\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],\"Inside the engagement window\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-legendItem\",\"data-stage\":\"after\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-legendMark\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],\"After the report — a commitment, not an upsell\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-legendItem\",\"data-stage\":\"standing\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-legendMark\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],\"Standing work with no fixed window\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-capNote\",\"children\":[\"Every bar is positioned and sized from that phase’s own stated schedule, converted to a single week axis and drawn to one scale. \",\"Nothing is rounded to make the picture tidier, and a phase whose schedule the service does not state — standing work, a quarterly cadence, anything open-ended — is drawn as a dotted row carrying its own words rather than handed a plausible-looking bar it never had.\"]}]]}]\n9f:[\"$\",\"article\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"stack__card\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__index\",\"children\":\"01 / 06\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__title\",\"children\":\"Scoping\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__body\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\",\"children\":\"3–5 days before start\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseBody\",\"children\":\"A 60-minute technical call, not a questionnaire. We agree targets, roles, test accounts, rate limits, out-of-hours windows and the escalation path for a critical. You get a written scope with explicit exclusions — what we will not test is as important as what we will.\"}]]}]]}]\na0:[\"$\",\"article\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"stack__card\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__index\",\"children\":\"02 / 06\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__title\",\"children\":\"Reconnaissance and mapping\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__body\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\",\"children\":\"Day 1\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseBody\",\"children\":\"The application is walked by hand with every supplied role, and the attack surface is mapped against the architecture you described. Where the two disagree, that difference is usually the first finding.\"}]]}]]}]\na1:[\"$\",\"article\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"stack__card\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__index\",\"children\":\"03 / 06\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__title\",\"children\":\"Manual testing\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__body\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\",\"children\":\"Days 2–8\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseBody\",\"children\":\"Tooling is used for coverage and nothing else. Every candidate finding is confirmed by hand before it reaches you. Criticals and highs are reported in the shared channel within the hour, with a reproduction path, so remediation can start while the test is still running.\"}]]}]]}]\na2:[\"$\",\"article\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"stack__card\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__index\",\"children\":\"04 / 06\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__title\",\"children\":\"Reporting\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__body\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\",\"children\":\"Days 9–11\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseBody\",\"children\":\"Findings are written for two readers: an executive summary a board can act on, and a technical body an engineer can work from. Severity uses CVSS v4.0 base plus an environmental adjustment we show our working for.\"}]]}]]}]\na3:[\"$\",\"article\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"stack__card\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__index\",\"children\":\"05 / 06\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__title\",\"children\":\"Debrief\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__body\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\",\"children\":\"Within 5 days of the report\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseBody\",\"children\":\"A 90-minute call with the testers who found the issues — not an account manager. Walk the findings, argue the severities, agree the remediation order.\"}]]}]]}]\na4:[\"$\",\"article\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"stack__card\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__index\",\"children\":\"06 / 06\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__title\",\"children\":\"Retest\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__body\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\",\"children\":\"Within 30 days\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseBody\",\"children\":\"Every finding retested and the report reissued with a verified status column. Anything still open is reopened with fresh evidence, not with the original screenshot.\"}]]}]]}]\na6:[\"$\",\"$Le\",null,{\"href\":\"/methodologies/severity-model\",\"className\":\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\",\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Read the methodology — How we score severity, and why we show the adjustment\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"btn__icon\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\